, "  AGG x mc, Q(none)                  half 0       -0.16 [-0.66, +0.33] p=0.518", "  AGG main, Q(none) n=3115           half 1       -0.49 [-1.06, +0.07] p=0.088", "  AGG x mc, Q(none)                  half 1       -0.05 [-0.54, +0.44] p=0.838", "  AGG slope by mc tercile (secondary)", "  AGG per card in lo-speed tercile, Q(a) all          -0.18 [-0.79, +0.43] p=0.565", "  AGG per card in mid-speed tercile, Q(a) all          +0.07 [-0.60, +0.73] p=0.847", "  AGG per card in hi-speed tercile, Q(a) all          -0.27 [-1.00, +0.45] p=0.464", "  AGG per card in lo-speed tercile, Q(b) all          -0.12 [-0.74, +0.50] p=0.708", "  AGG per card in mid-speed tercile, Q(b) all          +0.10 [-0.56, +0.77] p=0.764", "  AGG per card in hi-speed tercile, Q(b) all          -0.26 [-1.00, +0.48] p=0.488", "\nSensitivity, all formats (7556 decks), format dummy added:", "  mc ends-minus-middle, Q(a), all formats all          +0.18 [-0.18, +0.53] p=0.332", "  mc linear, Q(a), all formats       all          -0.21 [-0.78, +0.36] p=0.474", "  two ends-minus-middle, Q(a), all formats all          -0.18 [-0.55, +0.19] p=0.350", "  two linear, Q(a), all formats      all          +0.31 [-0.25, +0.88] p=0.273", "  AGG x mc, Q(a), all formats        all          -0.15 [-0.48, +0.18] p=0.373", "\n# B8 (b)(c) deck level: enters-tapped lands in clean two-colour decks (Premier, no splash)\n", "Population: 3481 decks, 2866 drafts. Per deck means: PW-on 0.47, SLOW-on 0.08, ALW-on 0.25, off-colour duals 0.01; WALK 4.11 (SD 2.27); WALK>=4 56.19%", "Distribution of counts (decks): pw_on: 0:2024, 1:1278, 2:179; slow_on: 0:3222, 1:249, 2:10; alw_on: 0:2709, 1:666, 2:97, 3:9; off: 0:3460, 1:16, 2:3, 3:1, 4:1; tap_on: 0:1442, 1:1407, 2:527, 3:91, 4:12, 5:2", "\n## P4 / P5: per-card effect (pts) of land classes, all entered together (replaces a basic; land count controlled)", "  on-colour PW dual, Q(a) n=3481     all          -0.19 [-1.49, +1.11] p=0.777", "  on-colour SLOW dual, Q(a) n=3481   all    